{
  "_comment": [
    "Event frame templates (§472). Each trigger names an ATTRIBUTE, resolved",
    "through the asset model, so the same template serves every unit.",
    "",
    "Every trigger carries a debounce: the condition must hold that long before",
    "it counts. A transmitter spike reading 3000 rpm must not open a start-up.",
    "The milestone timestamp is the instant the condition BECAME true, not the",
    "instant the debounce expired -- the difference is an artefact of how",
    "carefully we are watching, and reporting the later one would make every",
    "start-up look slower than it was.",
    "",
    "The milestone sequence follows a cold start-up: light-up, pressure raised",
    "to admission, steam admitted and the rotor turning, rated speed,",
    "synchronisation, full load. Steam admission is taken as main steam",
    "pressure reaching the admission threshold, because the simulator has no",
    "stop-valve position tag; on a real unit that tag is what you would use."
  ],
  "templates": [
    {
      "name": "ThermalStartup",
      "start": {"attribute": "LightUp", "comparison": ">=", "threshold": 1,
                "debounce_s": 2.0},
      "end": {"attribute": "GrossGeneration", "comparison": ">=",
              "threshold": 200, "debounce_s": 5.0},
      "max_duration_s": 10800,
      "milestones": [
        {"name": "boiler_lightup", "sort_order": 1,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "LightUp", "comparison": ">=",
                     "threshold": 1, "debounce_s": 2.0}},
        {"name": "steam_admission", "sort_order": 2,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "MainSteamPressure", "comparison": ">=",
                     "threshold": 100, "debounce_s": 4.0}},
        {"name": "turbine_rolling", "sort_order": 3,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "Speed", "comparison": ">",
                     "threshold": 50, "debounce_s": 3.0}},
        {"name": "rated_speed", "sort_order": 4,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "Speed", "comparison": ">=",
                     "threshold": 2950, "debounce_s": 4.0}},
        {"name": "synchronisation", "sort_order": 5,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "BreakerClosed", "comparison": ">=",
                     "threshold": 1, "debounce_s": 2.0}},
        {"name": "full_load", "sort_order": 6,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "GrossGeneration", "comparison": ">=",
                     "threshold": 200, "debounce_s": 5.0}}
      ],
      "summary_attributes": ["GrossGeneration", "MainSteamTemperature",
                             "MainSteamPressure", "CoalFlow", "Speed",
                             "Vibration"]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shutdown",
      "start": {"attribute": "BreakerClosed", "comparison": "<", "threshold": 1,
                "debounce_s": 3.0},
      "end": {"attribute": "Speed", "comparison": "<", "threshold": 50,
              "debounce_s": 5.0},
      "max_duration_s": 7200,
      "milestones": [
        {"name": "breaker_open", "sort_order": 1,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "BreakerClosed", "comparison": "<",
                     "threshold": 1, "debounce_s": 3.0}},
        {"name": "coast_down", "sort_order": 2,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "Speed", "comparison": "<",
                     "threshold": 2000, "debounce_s": 3.0}},
        {"name": "barring", "sort_order": 3,
         "trigger": {"attribute": "Speed", "comparison": "<",
                     "threshold": 50, "debounce_s": 5.0}}
      ],
      "summary_attributes": ["Speed", "Vibration", "MainSteamTemperature"]
    }
  ]
}
